;Description
:This template is used to link to a PixivFANBOX profile page.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{Fanbox|<fanboxsubdomain>}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <fanboxsubdomain> with the subdomain (first part) of the pixivfanbox url (e.g., if the url is https://nyanyannya.fanbox.cc/, the fanboxsubdomain will be "nyanyannya"). If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{Fanbox|nyanyannya|nyanyannya fanbox description}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Fanbox|nyanyannya|nyanyannya fanbox description}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.

